01:02:27.000 --> 01:02:38.050
<v Ira Glass>Support for This America Life comes from Keurig coffeemakers, bringing families together and defying the Mormon God for 30 years. I'm kidding. They're not an underwriter.
<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》的支持来自Keurig咖啡机，30年来让家庭聚在一起并违抗摩门教的神。我在开玩笑。他们不是承销商。

01:02:38.050 --> 01:02:49.850
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia, who loved his mother like crazy. Thought she was the best, until that day that he walked into her kitchen and saw a certain appliance there.
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生，他疯狂地爱着他的母亲。认为她是最好的，直到他走进她厨房看到某个家电的那天。

01:02:49.850 --> 01:02:52.630
<v Heather>And a good mom doesn't have a Keurig.
<v Heather>而且好妈妈是不会用Keurig的。

01:02:52.630 --> 01:02:57.630
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
